1
00:00:00,731 --> 00:00:02,900
As an artist, I want to tell you

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:07,204
that AI has completely changed the trajectory of my life.

3
00:00:07,204 --> 00:00:11,508
Let me show you into some of my worlds.

4
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,711
When some people were focused on productivity and efficiency,

5
00:00:14,711 --> 00:00:20,751
I'd been focused on trying to figure out how to incorporate AI into my art.

6
00:00:20,751 --> 00:00:26,690
Like a new paintbrush, a canvas, a camera, a music studio,

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:29,693
a doorway into my imagination.

8
00:00:29,693 --> 00:00:31,495
I’ve worked in film production,

9
00:00:31,495 --> 00:00:32,796
fashion

10
00:00:32,796 --> 00:00:34,798
and most recently as a graphic designer.

11
00:00:34,798 --> 00:00:39,736
But nothing has sparked my curiosity like AI has.

12
00:00:39,736 --> 00:00:42,906
My first images were less “visionary artist”

13
00:00:42,906 --> 00:00:45,242
and more, as my friends used to say,

14
00:00:45,242 --> 00:00:46,910
"What is that?"

15
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:49,880
But I leaned into the strangeness of the AI,

16
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,616
and now it has become my signature style.

17
00:00:52,616 --> 00:00:54,885
And I feel like I have a new superpower,

18
00:00:54,885 --> 00:00:57,988
and I'm only limited by my imagination,

19
00:00:57,988 --> 00:01:01,925
which seems to be endlessly fueled with ideas now.

20
00:01:01,925 --> 00:01:05,495
For the first time, the distance between what I imagined

21
00:01:05,495 --> 00:01:09,666
and what I could create has closed.

22
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:11,702
Once AI video was available,

23
00:01:11,702 --> 00:01:16,173
I started animating my AI images and making short films.

24
00:01:16,173 --> 00:01:18,342
But I felt like something was missing.

25
00:01:18,342 --> 00:01:20,677
So I wanted to make my own music

26
00:01:20,677 --> 00:01:24,081
to better match the emotion behind my visuals.

27
00:01:24,081 --> 00:01:29,319
So I started writing lyrics and using AI to collaborate on the instrumentation.

28
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:33,290
And I draw my inspiration for my lyrics from my visuals

29
00:01:33,290 --> 00:01:35,859
or from my life experiences.

30
00:01:35,859 --> 00:01:39,930
And I never thought that my music would take on a life of its own.

31
00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:43,734
But it has, as I just landed a record deal.

32
00:01:43,734 --> 00:01:45,736
(Applause and Cheers)

33
00:01:45,736 --> 00:01:51,341
Thank you. That feels extraordinary at this chapter of my life.

34
00:01:51,341 --> 00:01:54,378
When the music and the visual align perfectly,

35
00:01:54,378 --> 00:01:57,047
it can feel like magic.

36
00:01:57,047 --> 00:02:00,751
In this next clip I'm going to show you, from my video "Quiet Rebellion",

37
00:02:00,751 --> 00:02:04,454
I wrote these lyrics about living as your authentic self

38
00:02:04,454 --> 00:02:06,757
and wearing your strange like a crown.

39
00:02:06,757 --> 00:02:10,661
(Song) Let the rhythm be wide and the logic be thin.

40
00:02:10,661 --> 00:02:14,865
I'm living in the spaces where the secrets begin.

41
00:02:14,865 --> 00:02:19,036
It's a quiet rebellion, a soft kind of war.

42
00:02:19,036 --> 00:02:22,906
There'll be somethin' the world hasn't tasted before.

43
00:02:22,906 --> 00:02:27,010
There is a fire in the fold,

44
00:02:27,010 --> 00:02:30,781
a grace in the strange.

45
00:02:30,781 --> 00:02:34,751
I am ink on the page

46
00:02:34,751 --> 00:02:44,594
that refuses to change.

47
00:02:44,594 --> 00:02:45,862
(Cheers and Applause)

48
00:02:45,862 --> 00:02:49,966
Thank you. Thank you.

49
00:02:49,966 --> 00:02:53,170
Lately, people have been asking me these same two questions:

50
00:02:53,170 --> 00:02:56,373
Is it really art and how do you do it?

51
00:02:56,373 --> 00:02:58,742
And this first one's really hard for me to answer,

52
00:02:58,742 --> 00:03:00,177
because AI art is brand new,

53
00:03:00,177 --> 00:03:02,946
and we're all still trying to figure out where it fits in.

54
00:03:02,946 --> 00:03:05,816
And there [are] intense feelings on both sides,

55
00:03:05,816 --> 00:03:09,720
and lots of discussion about AI being trained on other artists’ work --

56
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:12,189
as I was as an art major.

57
00:03:12,189 --> 00:03:13,690
But when I sit down to create,

58
00:03:13,690 --> 00:03:15,826
there's no other artists' work on my screen.

59
00:03:15,826 --> 00:03:22,199
I use references from things in nature, like flowers or insects,

60
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:24,968
patterns, fashion, or whimsical ideas

61
00:03:24,968 --> 00:03:27,537
that have been floating around in my head.

62
00:03:27,537 --> 00:03:30,373
For me, art is personal.

63
00:03:30,373 --> 00:03:33,376
I just want to make things that bring me joy.

64
00:03:33,376 --> 00:03:35,579
And if they do the same to someone else, well,

65
00:03:35,579 --> 00:03:38,615
maybe that's the definition right there.

66
00:03:38,615 --> 00:03:40,016
And how do you do it?

67
00:03:40,016 --> 00:03:42,786
Let me take you behind the scenes for a moment.

68
00:03:42,786 --> 00:03:45,756
This image was made in Midjourney using this prompt,

69
00:03:45,756 --> 00:03:48,592
"A character in a fairy tale scene in a marketplace,

70
00:03:48,592 --> 00:03:49,860
enchanted and cinematic."

71
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:53,630
And it's an OK image. Very AI, nothing at all special.

72
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:57,701
Now here's that exact same prompt using my personalization code

73
00:03:57,701 --> 00:03:59,669
and the style reference code.

74
00:03:59,669 --> 00:04:02,739
And I've worked really hard to get my images to look like this.

75
00:04:02,739 --> 00:04:05,575
A lot of trial and error and time spent training the AI

76
00:04:05,575 --> 00:04:07,878
on my personal style and aesthetic.

77
00:04:07,878 --> 00:04:10,413
Now, here's a short clip of the final video.

78
00:04:10,413 --> 00:04:15,118
(Song) Welcome to the marketplace where nothing's ever priced the same.

79
00:04:15,118 --> 00:04:17,554
You trade your time, you trade your name,

80
00:04:17,554 --> 00:04:19,990
you have to laugh.

81
00:04:19,990 --> 00:04:22,325
The stalls are built from maybe-so,

82
00:04:22,325 --> 00:04:24,795
the cards all say "you'll know, you'll know".

83
00:04:24,795 --> 00:04:27,330
You buy a dream, it's buy-one-hope

84
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:29,566
and something extra.

85
00:04:29,566 --> 00:04:30,867
(Applause and Cheers)

86
00:04:30,867 --> 00:04:33,870
Thank you.

87
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:39,242
When AI is guided by human feeling, empathy and intention,

88
00:04:39,242 --> 00:04:42,212
it could become something else entirely.

89
00:04:42,212 --> 00:04:44,214
You can't explain creativity.

90
00:04:44,214 --> 00:04:46,616
You just follow it.

91
00:04:46,616 --> 00:04:48,218
But this is what I do know.

92
00:04:48,218 --> 00:04:50,320
I started making the best work of my life

93
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:53,190
since I started using AI as a cocreator,

94
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:56,259
and my life has taken off like a rocket ship.

95
00:04:56,259 --> 00:04:59,763
Millions of people have found their way to my work through my social sites

96
00:04:59,763 --> 00:05:01,298
and music apps.

97
00:05:01,298 --> 00:05:07,037
And I feel different, I feel lighter, I feel curious again,

98
00:05:07,037 --> 00:05:08,905
and I love using this technology

99
00:05:08,905 --> 00:05:11,341
to tell stories that are close to my heart.

100
00:05:11,341 --> 00:05:13,910
This next clip is a tribute to older generations

101
00:05:13,910 --> 00:05:15,946
and not losing your sense of wonder.

102
00:05:15,946 --> 00:05:28,491
(Music)

103
00:05:28,491 --> 00:05:31,428
(Laughter)

104
00:05:31,428 --> 00:05:35,131
(Song) The restless chase has drifted by,

105
00:05:35,131 --> 00:05:39,169
no longer racing for the prize.

106
00:05:39,169 --> 00:05:42,539
Now we savor morning's sigh

107
00:05:42,539 --> 00:05:47,510
and see new wonder in old eyes.

108
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,545
(Applause)

109
00:05:48,545 --> 00:05:51,581
Thank you.

110
00:05:51,581 --> 00:05:54,451
I feel like we're standing at the beginning of a renaissance,

111
00:05:54,451 --> 00:05:57,087
and the possibilities are endless.

112
00:05:57,087 --> 00:06:00,857
We haven't even tapped into all of the ways to use AI creatively.

113
00:06:00,857 --> 00:06:04,427
And people who have never felt creative a day in their life

114
00:06:04,427 --> 00:06:07,297
are trying AI and sparking that creativity

115
00:06:07,297 --> 00:06:08,965
for the first time.

116
00:06:08,965 --> 00:06:11,234
And that's incredible.

117
00:06:11,234 --> 00:06:15,205
So my takeaway for today is if you are curious about AI,

118
00:06:15,205 --> 00:06:17,908
try to play a little and make something beautiful

119
00:06:17,908 --> 00:06:19,943
or make something strange,

120
00:06:19,943 --> 00:06:22,612
but let yourself be surprised by what comes out.

121
00:06:22,612 --> 00:06:24,481
But most of all, find your joy.

122
00:06:24,481 --> 00:06:31,621
(Song) I never found a reason why I had to learn to dance.

123
00:06:31,621 --> 00:06:35,191
My feet and music found each other.

124
00:06:35,191 --> 00:06:38,828
We knew it at first glance.

125
00:06:38,828 --> 00:06:42,365
From the moment I could walk

126
00:06:42,365 --> 00:06:46,069
my feet just up and ran.

127
00:06:46,069 --> 00:06:49,239
When I hear a song, I see a floor,

128
00:06:49,239 --> 00:06:52,842
my feet just understand.

129
00:06:52,842 --> 00:06:54,711
Thank you so much. Thank you.

130
00:06:54,711 --> 00:06:58,711
(Applause and Cheers)
